{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "afb2a832r9nsheov", "title": "53.LangGraph子图可控性", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"uac8c2ecf\" id=\"uac8c2ecf\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf4500da3\" id=\"uf4500da3\">示例代码</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0b0c1578\" id=\"u0b0c1578\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fppt%2F1387387%2F1745159946302-18358e08-0ea6-4b72-a5ee-3007dd340c61.ppt%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22langgraph-controllability.ppt%22%2C%22size%22%3A78425%2C%22ext%22%3A%22ppt%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub9dddeb5-40c1-4305-b0ce-e4b8d0febd2%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fvnd.ms-powerpoint%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u96424259%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2a34d5f0\" id=\"u2a34d5f0\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u9eed3d13\" id=\"u9eed3d13\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压</span></em></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9d0f9788\" id=\"u9d0f9788\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5b6ccf17\" id=\"u5b6ccf17\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">python版本：3.12.4</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubfef54ad\" id=\"ubfef54ad\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6bd13ee1\" id=\"u6bd13ee1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"BKx4g\" id=\"BKx4g\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50131285\" id=\"u50131285\">子图可控性</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uda60adb7\" id=\"uda60adb7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub76a2681\" id=\"ub76a2681\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(25, 27, 31)\">在复杂的多代理协作场景中，LangGraph 支持子图之间的状态共享。主图可以通过状态对象与子图交互，确保各子图能够访问和更新全局状态。</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u47d075ce\" id=\"u47d075ce\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(25, 27, 31)\">这种机制使得多个智能体可以协同工作，同时保持状态的一致性。</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"uccaef5ae\" id=\"uccaef5ae\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc0f76460\" id=\"uc0f76460\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">对于更复杂的系统，子图是一个有用的设计原则。子图允许您在图的不同部分创建和管理不同的状态。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9995eec4\" id=\"u9995eec4\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1723622320067-c1d2303f-368b-434b-bbf2-991f4211670e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uf3984a57-413e-49fe-9b75-559b81d1e70%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u45d08ea4-049f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A99160%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1177%2C%22originHeight%22%3A818%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.3125%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fdfdfd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u5b353528%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%25pip%20install%20-U%20langgraph%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HRnXa%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud268e2cf\" id=\"ud268e2cf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u04816f8f\" id=\"u04816f8f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">示例：我有一个接受日志并执行两个独立子任务的系统。首先，它将对它们进行总结。其次，它将总结日志中捕获的任何故障模式。我想在两个不同的子图中执行这两个操作。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud620fad0\" id=\"ud620fad0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud08bf183\" id=\"ud08bf183\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">最重要的是要认识到图之间的信息传递。</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua62eeb27\" id=\"ua62eeb27\"><span data-lake-id=\"u772e07b4\" id=\"u772e07b4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">入口图</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9dec5f03\" id=\"u9dec5f03\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uf6ccfd50\" id=\"uf6ccfd50\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">是父级，两个子图中的每一个都被定义为</span><span data-lake-id=\"ucb7da83a\" id=\"ucb7da83a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u91226e98\" id=\"u91226e98\"><span data-lake-id=\"uca6a98df\" id=\"uca6a98df\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">入口图</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u724382d1\" id=\"u724382d1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u1ed3b5cd\" id=\"u1ed3b5cd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">中的节点。两个子图都继承了父级</span><span data-lake-id=\"u470c2595\" id=\"u470c2595\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u656ebd7c\" id=\"u656ebd7c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8fe5107a\" id=\"u8fe5107a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">入口图</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u64fb28e7\" id=\"u64fb28e7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ua2ca3643\" id=\"ua2ca3643\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">的状态；我可以在每个子图中访问</span><span data-lake-id=\"u1c8ba794\" id=\"u1c8ba794\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u2e71a8c3\" id=\"u2e71a8c3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u750766f9\" id=\"u750766f9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">docs</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4ad0524f\" id=\"u4ad0524f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">，只需在子图状态中指定它（参见图）。每个子图都可以有自己的私有状态。任何我想传播回父级</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua824ffc1\" id=\"ua824ffc1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u395c2939\" id=\"u395c2939\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7c1db408\" id=\"u7c1db408\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">入口图</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0a08f653\" id=\"u0a08f653\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u0d022b6b\" id=\"u0d022b6b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">的值（用于最终报告）只需在我的</span><span data-lake-id=\"uce00cd88\" id=\"uce00cd88\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u16b31b19\" id=\"u16b31b19\"><span data-lake-id=\"u30b84161\" id=\"u30b84161\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">入口图</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud5955ab3\" id=\"ud5955ab3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u33fb1fd9\" id=\"u33fb1fd9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">状态中定义即可（例如，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u82528ffd\" id=\"u82528ffd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2a4c88c2\" id=\"u2a4c88c2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">summary report</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2161b57f\" id=\"u2161b57f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ube672fea\" id=\"ube672fea\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">和</span><span data-lake-id=\"u6faec6f8\" id=\"u6faec6f8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u6dded5fb\" id=\"u6dded5fb\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc9d61018\" id=\"uc9d61018\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">failure report</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1ee8e8d1\" id=\"u1ee8e8d1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">）。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9e9e3e8b\" id=\"u9e9e3e8b\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1723622320145-1a0eb1e8-e12a-4dce-8bce-1df82b8dd84d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ua640f2b8-bf0e-449b-814a-c3f28447e2b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u45d08ea4-049f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A130606%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1513%2C%22originHeight%22%3A725%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.3125%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fdfcfc%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u4a0f2a3b%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9Asub_graph.py%5Cnfrom%20typing%20import%20List%2C%20TypedDict%2C%20Optional%5Cnfrom%20langgraph.graph%20import%20StateGraph%2C%20START%2C%20END%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97%E7%9A%84%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%5Cnclass%20Logs(TypedDict)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20id%3A%20str%20%20%23%20%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97%E7%9A%84%E5%94%AF%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%87%E8%AF%86%E7%AC%A6%5Cn%20%20%20%20question%3A%20str%20%20%23%20%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC%5Cn%20%20%20%20docs%3A%20Optional%5BList%5D%20%20%23%20%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%89%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%5Cn%20%20%20%20answer%3A%20str%20%20%23%20%E5%9B%9E%E7%AD%94%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC%5Cn%20%20%20%20